12. Split Methods

Support four split methods.

Equal Split
₹4,000 / 4 members

Shub     ₹1,000
Rahul    ₹1,000
Amit     ₹1,000
Priya    ₹1,000
Exact Amount
Shub     ₹1,500
Rahul    ₹1,000
Amit       ₹500
Priya    ₹1,000

The total must equal the expense amount.

Percentage
Shub     40%
Rahul    20%
Amit     20%
Priya    20%

Percentages must equal 100%.

Shares
Shub     2 shares
Rahul    1 share
Amit     1 share
Priya    2 shares

Calculate each participant's amount based on their share.

Use an enum:

enum SplitMethod {
    case equal
    case exactAmount
    case percentage
    case shares
}

Do not use raw strings throughout the application.

