16. Settlement — Basic MVP

Settlement functionality must remain very basic.

The app is only tracking whether money has been settled.

Do NOT implement:

UPI
Payment gateways
Bank transfers
Payment APIs
Real-money transaction processing
Payment verification
Payment provider integrations

Settlement model:

id
groupId
fromUser
toUser
amount
status
createdAt
settledAt

Status:

pending
paid

Example:

Amit owes Shub ₹2,000

[ Mark as Paid ]

After marking it paid:

Amit paid Shub ₹2,000

Status: Paid

The app does not actually transfer money.

It only records the settlement status.

